    + reflexivity.
    + reflexivity.
    + exact (gso_1RB0LB_0RC0LA_1RD1RC_1LD1LB p j' E).
    + exact (geo_1RB0LB_0RC0LA_1RD1RC_1LD1LB p j' E).
